      <widget class="QLabel" name="about_groups_label">
       <property name="text">
        <string>• Assign a condition group to each report file. Any group label is accepted, and the number of groups is unlimited.&lt;br/&gt;• At the cohort level, the report files with the same group label are put together.&lt;br/&gt;• To analyze the subjects of one report in two groups, create two separate report files, one for each group.&lt;br/&gt;• Every report file needs a group before the run.</string>
